    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F12996725EAB798A",
      "text": "Lately, I feel that...something is the matter with\\nme.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F12995725EAB77D7",
      "text": "I sometimes feel an ache within my chest, and my\\nappetite is dampened.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F12994725EAB7624",
      "text": "But when I go to the nurse’s office, I am told that\\nnothing is amiss.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F12993725EAB7471",
      "text": "Is it possible that my symptoms are the result\\nof some sort of physiological change?[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "56E9BF2FE7EA6109",
      "text": "Any ideas what it could be?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "56E9BC2FE7EA5BF0",
      "text": "When do your symptoms occur?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F12992725EAB72BE",
      "text": "I have no idea whatsoever.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "7516B456DD542BD4",
      "text": "They occur with no regularity whatsoever.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "F12991725EAB710B",
      "text": "I suppose the sole common factor is that...these\\nsymptoms arise when I think of Kieran.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_hagane_sp03_07",
      "hash64": "F12990725EAB6F58",
      "text": "But surely no causal relationship can be found\\nthere.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
